  "notes": "Adds a read-only IR optical diagnostic cache for raw range, sensor status, total and ambient rates, SPAD count, and optional checked register reads at 0x09, 0x20, and 0x28 under the existing diagnostic owner. Adds a separate cache-only IR OPTICS DUMP diagnostic command. This release makes no calibration, filtering, generation, or Auto behavior correction claim. The 0.1.542b candidate is not installed; hardware acceptance remains pending. The previous installed 0.1.541b passed its prior OTA autoboot check. SW6106 charger diagnostics remain paused by user request.",
